<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Sugar to tender for 10,000 T U.S. soy/corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Sugar to tender for 10,000 T U.S. soy/corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Taiwan Sugar Corp will tender for a 10,000-tonne position of No.2 or better U.S. yellow corn on Friday, traders said.  </p>
<p>Details for the tender as follow:</p>
<p>		     U.S. Gulf  Pacific N.W.</p>
<p>		     Dec 10-31  Jan 1-20</p>
<p>		     Corn     10,000</p>
<p>Traders said Taiwan Sugar would also tender soon for another combined shipment of 18,000-tonne U.S. corn and 12,000-tonne U.S. soybeans slated for delivery between late October to early November.</p>
<p>--Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
